  m_text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi xem c\xF3 th\u1EC3 kh\xE1m ph\xE1 c\xE1c hi\u1EC7n v\u1EADt
    qu\xFD gi\xE1, tranh s\u1ED1 h\xF3a v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED9 chi ti\u1EBFt cao,
    v\xE0 di chuy\u1EC3n trong kh\xF4ng gian tri\u1EC3n l\xE3m th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF
    \u1EA3o. C\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 AR/VR cho ph\xE9p t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c tr\u1EF1c
    ti\u1EBFp v\u1EDBi b\u1EA3o v\u1EADt, xem th\xF4ng tin \u0111a t\u1EA7ng v\xE0
    th\u01B0\u1EDFng th\u1EE9c ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt theo c\xE1ch m\u1EDBi. H\u1EC7
    th\u1ED1ng thuy\u1EBFt minh AI, m\xF4 h\xECnh 3D, video, \xE2m thanh gi\xFAp
    t\xE1i hi\u1EC7n di s\u1EA3n m\u1ED9t c\xE1ch ch\xE2n th\u1EF1c, hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i
    v\xE0 s\xE1ng t\u1EA1o."
